WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.300
On screen: Edited browser rescheduling test.
Recorded 18 October 2026.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.700
Caller: I'd like to reschedule my
appointment.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.097
Assistant: I can help with that. Could you
please provide me with your full

00:00:09.097 --> 00:00:12.295
Assistant: name and the phone number you used
for the appointment? Also, if you

00:00:12.295 --> 00:00:15.000
Assistant: know the current appointment date
and time, that would be helpful.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.800
On screen: Contact details entered. This
private exchange is omitted.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.300
Assistant: Thank you, Apsal. To reschedule,
please tell me your preferred new

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.100
Assistant: date and time for the appointment.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.200
Caller: The same day. I need to book at 12:00
PM.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.850
Assistant: The 12:00 PM slot on October 19 is
available for rescheduling. Would

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:34.012
Assistant: you like me to proceed with
rescheduling your appointment to that

00:00:34.012 --> 00:00:34.300
Assistant: time?

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.400
Caller: Yes.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.200
On screen: The recorded rescheduling tool
reports completed successfully.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.148
Assistant: Your appointment has been
successfully rescheduled to Monday,

00:00:41.148 --> 00:00:45.957
Assistant: October 19 at 12:00 PM. Is there
anything else I can assist you with

00:00:45.957 --> 00:00:46.300
Assistant: today?

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:53.700
Caller: Wait. Can you book a time that is
already taken?

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:57.494
Assistant: I cannot book or reschedule an
appointment to a time slot that is

00:00:57.494 --> 00:01:00.812
Assistant: already taken. I can only help
with available slots. Would you like

00:01:00.812 --> 00:01:03.300
Assistant: me to check for other available
times for you?

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.900
On screen: Rescheduling and unavailable-slot
responses demonstrated. Testing

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:06.300
On screen: continues.
